petalOS
===========

Getting started
---------------

To get started with petalOS maintaining/building, you'll need to get familiar with [Source Control Tools](https://source.android.com/setup/develop).

To initialize your local repository using the LineageOS trees, use a command like this:
```
repo init -u https://github.com/https://github.com/petalFTW/manifest.git --git-lfs
```
Then to sync up:
```
repo sync
```
# Build petal

# Set up environment
```bash
. build/envsetup.sh
```

# Build the code
```bash
lunch petal_<codename>-bp4a-user
m bacon
```
